  "details": "<p>The <em>Barrington Atlas Directory</em> notes: near, but not at, Horta. The modern locality of Seripola, a river port associated with ancient Horta (modern Orte) has been suggested as the possible location of Castellum Amerinum. The Roman river port was discovered in 1962-63.</p>",
